silm:instances_papers_01_orientation_chapters_flat_sections_05_cannon_or_gpt_absorption_yoneda_hom_leg_10 silm:hasExample "In '05CannonOrGptAbsorptionYonedaHomLeg10', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, Felis catus (TSN 183798) is the taxonomy leg of Mittens; it is not Mittens." .
